Employee Directory Search System

A full-stack employee directory application built using React, Vite, Python, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL. The application is designed to help users find employee information by searching for an employee's name or department.

This project focuses on building a maintainable application with a clean separation between the frontend, backend, and database, while keeping search requests efficient and handling API states clearly.

Project Overview

The main objective is to build a simple, responsive employee directory that makes employee information easy to search and view.

Each employee record contains:

Employee ID

Full name

Email address

Department

Designation

Date of joining

